<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>User Already Exists</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Segoe UI,Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff512f,#dd2476,#6a11cb,#2575fc);display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;">

<div style="width:420px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);border-radius:25px;padding:40px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);animation:pop .6s ease;">

    <div style="width:100px;height:100px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin:auto;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(255,255,255,.4);font-size:55px;color:#ff3b3b;">
        ⚠
    </div>

    <h1 style="margin-top:25px;font-size:34px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;">
        User Already Exists
    </h1>

    <p style="color:#f5f5f5;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;margin-top:15px;">
        The account you're trying to create is already registered in our system.
        Please sign in using your existing account or use a different email address.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top:30px;">

        <a href="/login"
        style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:#ffffff;color:#6a11cb;font-weight:bold;padding:14px 35px;border-radius:50px;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.3s;">
            Login
        </a>

        <a href="/register"
        style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:transparent;border:2px solid #fff;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;padding:12px 30px;border-radius:50px;font-size:17px;margin-left:12px;transition:.3s;">
            Register Again
        </a>

    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:30px;color:#ffffffb3;font-size:14px;">
        Need help? Contact our support team anytime.
    </p>

</div>

<style>
@keyframes pop{
    0%{
        transform:scale(.6);
        opacity:0;
    }
    100%{
        transform:scale(1);
        opacity:1;
    }
}

a:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    opacity:.95;
}
</style>

</body>
</html>